---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Us">
  <div class="bg-gray-50 py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A2B4C] mb-8">About Us</h1>
      
      <div class="prose prose-lg text-gray-700 max-w-none">
        <p class="lead text-xl mb-8">
          The <strong>Benedictine Foundation Pax et Sapientia - ETS</strong> is a Third Sector Entity established on the initiative of the Sant'Anselmo Primatial Abbey.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#1A2B4C] mt-12 mb-4">Our Purposes</h2>
        <p>
          Inspired by the values of participation, solidarity, and pluralism, the Foundation pursues civic and social utility purposes. Our main activities include:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 my-6">
          <li>Education, instruction, and vocational training.</li>
          <li>Protection and enhancement of cultural heritage and landscape.</li>
          <li>Scientific research of particular social interest.</li>
          <li>Development cooperation and promotion of the culture of peace.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#1A2B4C] mt-12 mb-4">Our Office</h2>
        <p>
          The Foundation has its registered office at: <br />
          <strong>Piazza dei Cavalieri di Malta, 5 - 00153 Rome, Italy</strong>
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#1A2B4C] mt-12 mb-4">Governance</h2>
        <p>
          The Foundation is administered by a Board of Directors that operates with expertise and diligence to achieve the statutory purposes and safeguard the entity's heritage.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
